  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d21438f07bf2e8446b0a1da7bf64f675, type: 3}
  m_Name: Day10
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dayNumber: 10
  storyText: "We were sitting in silence when suddenly \u2014 footsteps. Running.
    Fast. Outside in the hallway. Then a growl. Low, wet, hungry. The zombie was
    chasing someone. We didn't open the door. We didn't look through the peephole.
    We just sat there, frozen, listening. The running got louder. Then the screaming
    started. Short scream. Cut off too fast. Then nothing. Just the growl. Then that
    stopped too. We didn't sleep well last night. We didn't sleep at all.\r"
